WEBVTT

00:39:58.560 --> 00:40:00.096
Our show is mixed by Rick Kwan.

00:40:00.120 --> 00:40:03.376
Original music by Hansdale Hsu
and Allison Leyton-Brown.

00:40:03.400 --> 00:40:06.336
Ad stories produced
by Pineapple Street Studios.

00:40:06.360 --> 00:40:10.146
Special thanks to our sponsors,
Accenture, BetterUp,

00:40:10.170 --> 00:40:12.138
Hilton and SAP.

00:40:12.640 --> 00:40:15.402
For their research, thanks
to Christina Maslach on burnout,

00:40:15.426 --> 00:40:18.936
Teresa Amabile on progress,
Karl Weick on small wins,

00:40:18.960 --> 00:40:21.112
Sabine Sonnentag on helping others,

00:40:21.136 --> 00:40:24.376
Wilmar Schaufeli and Arnold Bakker
on burnout contagion,

00:40:24.400 --> 00:40:25.869
Robert Karasek and colleagues,

00:40:25.893 --> 00:40:29.446
and Margot van der Doef
and Stan Maes on demand, control, support,

00:40:29.470 --> 00:40:32.666
Mandy O'Neill and Nancy Rothbard
on cultures of care,